{"3753240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Septurian Might", "steam_appid": 3753240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Septura, where every creature is born with brilliance, wit, and wisdom.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, unfortunately, possess none of these attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're Nino, a human stranded on the smartest planet in existence. Outmatched by everyone around you, your only way to survive is to steal intellect from your enemies and turn their abilities into your own, evolving from a helpless human into the most dangerous mind in the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/1383ec990fde9d3aec10b9cf2e466381.avif?t=1783949409\" width=1280 height=152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/de0dadf4c4d8d1f93f9cf8c73289896b.poster.avif?t=1783949409\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/de0dadf4c4d8d1f93f9cf8c73289896b.webm?t=1783949409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/de0dadf4c4d8d1f93f9cf8c73289896b.mp4?t=1783949409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 enemies roam Septura, each wielding a unique power. Defeat them, steal their intellect, and permanently add their abilities to your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend stolen intellect across 25 unique skills and 100+ abilities, shaping Nino into a melee bruiser, ranged tactician, spell-slinging genius, or something far stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy is a puzzle, every boss a test. Read patterns, punish openings, and survive more than 30 demanding boss fights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/d67ccf3aced53fd604d590f24b67d4ba.avif?t=1783949409\" width=1280 height=152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/3181f93628bb95409bfff619603a5c5a.poster.avif?t=1783949409\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/3181f93628bb95409bfff619603a5c5a.webm?t=1783949409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/3181f93628bb95409bfff619603a5c5a.mp4?t=1783949409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through hand-drawn landscapes, forgotten ruins, and strange civilizations across Septura.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a story-driven adventure of friendship, sacrifice, and meaningful choices, where the least likely hero on Septura becomes its only hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/945a4a19fc812924493c199aef360140.avif?t=1783949409\" width=1280 height=152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/7216c93ac62346db067221595b03a15b.poster.avif?t=1783949409\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/7216c93ac62346db067221595b03a15b.webm?t=1783949409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/7216c93ac62346db067221595b03a15b.mp4?t=1783949409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, five legendary thinkers known as the Senses unlocked the power to enhance intelligence itself, transforming Septura into the most advanced civilization in the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries later, the tyrant Osmantal forged the Cereblade, a weapon that steals intellect from its victims, and used it to conquer worlds in pursuit of Septura's lost knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with Septura on the brink of collapse, its fate rests in the hands of Nino, an ordinary human who has somehow found himself at the center of an extraordinary conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Septura, where every creature is born with brilliance, wit, and wisdom.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, unfortunately, possess none of these attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're Nino, a human stranded on the smartest planet in existence. Outmatched by everyone around you, your only way to survive is to steal intellect from your enemies and turn their abilities into your own, evolving from a helpless human into the most dangerous mind in the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/1383ec990fde9d3aec10b9cf2e466381.avif?t=1783949409\" width=1280 height=152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.s